{"id":"wb-7-1529","name":"南山造像","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南山造像","text":"南山造像位于中国浙江省杭州市余杭区瓶窑镇南山东南麓，此处原为采石留下的裸露岩壁，元、明时期开凿摩崖造像，现存23尊。其中元朝14尊，以阿弥陀佛像为主，单体规模较大，最大一尊通高近10米，是中国罕见的元代大型摩崖造像群。其内容、风格、施造者身份都与同在杭州的飞来峰元代造像不同，展现出元代造像的另一种风貌。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E5%B1%B1%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F","revisionId":92677891,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92677891","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/80dae261665cadd419392916.jpg","title":"Nanshan_Stone_Carving,_2018-10-27_19.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nanshan_Stone_Carving,_2018-10-27_19.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/Nanshan_Stone_Carving%2C_2018-10-27_19.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​瓶窑南山石刻造像","width":320,"height":214}}